cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DataSentry in research or a published workflow, please cite the versioned software release."
type: software
title: "DataSentry: Local-First Data Quality Discovery and Safe Repair"
authors:
  - family-names: Xiao
    given-names: Zhiren
version: 1.0.4
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: https://github.com/Jackxiaozhiren/datasentry/releases/tag/v1.0.4
repository-code: https://github.com/Jackxiaozhiren/datasentry
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  DataSentry is a local-first data-quality toolkit that detects suspicious
  patterns, explains findings with evidence, and supports previewable,
  reversible repair workflows. Deterministic detection works without an LLM;
  optional AI suggestions remain proposals.
keywords:
  - data quality
  - data profiling
  - data cleaning
  - data drift
  - data repair
  - reproducibility
  - local-first
